                    "updatedAt": "2026-10-27T19:49:12Z",
                    "body": "Thank you @iluuu1994, I appreciate the response. \n\nI am working on an EBNF grammar specification for PHP 8.6 and just wanted to get some input regarding this from the community."
                },
                {
                    "id": 6455687623,
                    "url": "https://github.com/php/php-src/issues/24795#issuecomment-6455687623",
