                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "createdAt": "2026-10-27T23:00:29Z",
                    "updatedAt": "2026-10-27T23:00:29Z",
                    "body": "No worries. Here's a demonstration that this affects all compile errors: https://3v4l.org/bpPsX We skip compilation of the rhs when it is known to be dead at compile time. A fix would be non-trivial, requiring compilation of the AST while discarding the generated opcodes. I don't think that's worth the complexity.\n\nBut if you disagree, feel free to start a discussion in [internals](https://news-web.php.net/php.internals). \ud83d\ude42 \n\nThanks for the report."
                },
